{"step_index":5423,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T16:29:30Z","thinking":"The code iterates through warehouse results to gather all confirmed shortage items, ensuring that duplicates are avoided. Subsequently, the logic prepares data for a review process, initializing structures to track reviewed pairs. The goal is to collect and prepare data related to shortages for a review mechanism, likely involving identification of specific items or relationships needing attention.\n\n\nThe logic filters out items already confirmed as matched in a warehouse, preventing redundant review requests. The pharmacist only sees items needing review if they are not definitively matched elsewhere, streamlining the process. This ensures shortages without confirmed matches appear in a separate \"not found\" section.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Refine review_rows in excel_writer.py to exclude confirmed matched items\"","EndLine":"271","Instruction":"\"Filter out items already confirmed in a warehouse sheet\"","ReplacementContent":"\"    # تجميع جميع الأصناف التي تمت مطابقتها بالفعل في أي مخزن لتجنب إشغال الصيدلي بها\\n    all_confirmed_shortages = set()\\n    for wh_data in warehouse_results.values():\\n        for match in wh_data.get(\\\"matched\\\", []):\\n            name = match.get(\\\"shortage_item\\\", \\\"\\\")\\n            if name:\\n                all_confirmed_shortages.add(name.strip())\\n\\n    review_rows = []\\n    seen_review_pairs = set()\\n    for wh_name, wh_data in warehouse_results.items():\\n        for item in wh_data.get(\\\"needs_review\\\", []):\\n            req_item = item.get(\\\"shortage_item\\\", \\\"\\\").strip()\\n            wh_item = item.get(\\\"warehouse_item\\\", \\\"\\\").strip()\\n            if req_item in all_confirmed_shortages:\\n                continue\\n            pair_key = (req_item, wh_item, wh_name)\\n            if pair_key in seen_review_pairs:\\n                continue\\n            seen_review_pairs.add(pair_key)\\n            review_rows.append(\\n                [\\n                    \\\"\\\", # خانة القرار فارغة ليختار منها الصيدلي\\n                    req_item,\\n                    wh_item,\\n                    wh_name,\\n                    item.get(\\\"reason\\\", \\\"\\\"),\\n                ]\\n            )\"","StartLine":"259","TargetContent":"\"    review_rows = []\\n    for wh_name, wh_data in warehouse_results.items():\\n        for item in wh_data.get(\\\"needs_review\\\", []):\\n            review_rows.append(\\n                [\\n                    \\\"\\\", # خانة القرار فارغة ليختار منها الصيدلي\\n                    item.get(\\\"shortage_item\\\", \\\"\\\"),\\n                    item.get(\\\"warehouse_item\\\", \\\"\\\"),\\n                    wh_name,\\n                    item.get(\\\"reason\\\", \\\"\\\"),\\n                ]\\n            )\"","TargetFile":"\"d:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\\\\src\\\\output\\\\excel_writer.py\"","toolAction":"\"Updating review sheet creation in excel_writer.py\"","toolSummary":"\"Exclude already confirmed matches from review sheet\""}}]}
